{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011MexgxJcvDN47eAAZKdNbm","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Next.js latest stable release version npm\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Next.js 15\",\"url\":\"https://nextjs.org/blog/next-15\"},{\"title\":\"Next.js 16.3\",\"url\":\"https://nextjs.org/blog/next-16-3\"},{\"title\":\"Wiki.js\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wiki.js\"},{\"title\":\"Next.js\",\"url\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/next\"},{\"title\":\"Vercel Next.js releases, versions & end-of-life (EOL) dates\",\"url\":\"https://www.versio.io/en/product-release-end-of-life-eol-vercel-nextjs.html\"},{\"title\":\"next - npm\",\"url\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/next?activeTab=versions\"},{\"title\":\"Next.js Latest Version - Release History, LTS & EOL\",\"url\":\"https://versionlog.com/nextjs/\"},{\"title\":\"Next.js Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://next-changelog.malezjaa.tech/\"},{\"title\":\"Next.js Latest Version June 2026: 16.2.7 Current Stable on npm\",\"url\":\"https://abhs.in/blog/nextjs-current-version-march-2026-stable-release-whats-new\"}]\n\nThe most authoritative answer is **Next.js 16.4.2**, which the npm registry lists under the `latest` tag. The npm page shows Latest version: 16.4.2 and a table of dist-tags where 16.4.2 is tagged `latest`. (Current Tags)\n\nOther sources lag behind that:\n- Versionlog reports 16.4.0 as the latest stable, released 06 Oct 2026. (Latest Stable 16.4.0)\n- Versio lists 16.4.1 as the latest, dated 2026-10-15. (Latest version date 2026-10-15)\n- The Next.js 16.3 release post is from August 2026 and recommends running `npm install next@latest`. (Upgrade today: npm install next@latest)\n\nThe 16.x line is the current major. Version 15 is nearing end of life, with a support end date of 21 Oct 2026 per Versionlog. Because the npm page's own timestamps and the third-party trackers disagree slightly, running `npm show next version` gives the live answer.\n\n\nREMIN